(text "DI-8 CARD, card type 0x0010. Fits any universal LV slot (LV coding notch).\nSelf-contained: own bias supply (copy of baseline bank-B switch/eFuse, fed\nfrom VBAT_FIELD), own 74HC14 Schmitt triggers, own MCP23S17 on the slot SPI\nbus.\nMCP23S17: GPA0-7 = IN1_N..IN8_N; GPB0 BIAS_ON, GPB1 BIAS_DISCH, GPB2/GPB3\nunused (NC, GPPU on), GPB4-7 slot ID straps (GPPU on). CARD_FAULT_N (TPS26621\nFLT, open drain, 62 V abs max to RTN) goes to the slot only; pulled up on the\nbackplane, read by U-exp 0x22.\nSlot logic behind IOFF buffers (74LVC125A in, 1G125 MISO + 33R, 1G07 INT_N,\nINTA_B 100k pull-up): an unpowered card never loads the slot bus.\nBaseline names: IN1..IN8 = DI5..DI12, BIAS = DI_BIAS_B. Net changes:\nnet_changes.csv." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 158.75 229.87 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "f14fb09b-af00-49b9-b24a-a68da5237f16"))
(sheet_instances (path "/" (page "1")))
